  "content": "<h2>机械动力：列车灯光</h2><p>也请看看我的其他模组：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-trainutilities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力：列车配件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-more-seats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力：更多座位</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dab894f613724987b6fde69b92ed96344a199abc_0.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>本模组为机械动力添加了列车内部的定制灯组、头灯和尾灯，这些灯光会根据行驶方向自动切换头/尾灯功能。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/DkcprwueFj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discord.com/api/guilds/1248636479627071488/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h2>依赖</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力 (Forge)</a> / <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力 Fabric</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchitectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>功能</h2>\n<h3>概览视频</h3>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe height=\"300\" width=\"550px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xErJQp5fpWs?si=GN6k2pMxVDsjeVrt\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<h3>头灯/尾灯</h3>\n<div style=\"display:flex\"><img width=\"49.5%\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d4c9e507041466663f9c1ce8675fbe90d65cfb2f_0.webp\" alt=\"图片一\"> <img style=\"margin-left:20px\" width=\"49.5%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b6f360c0f4a63f97f4e05d53d1c8c7a369a8c61_0.webp\" alt=\"图片二\"></div>\n<p>……还有更多！</p>\n<h3>车内灯光</h3>\n<div style=\"display:flex\"><img width=\"49.5%\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/50c38a6ede9244d0db7f389b669631e8aac9476b_0.webp\" alt=\"图片一\"> <img style=\"margin-left:20px\" width=\"49.5%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5135e7171a59d39a1fd66010bbbea4ef4f60a1f5_0.webp\" alt=\"图片二\"></div>\n<p>……还有更多！</p>\n<h3>更多特性</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>可手动关闭</li>\n<li>头灯和尾灯根据行驶方向变换颜色</li>\n<li>可通过右键和机械控制装置来操控动态装置上的灯光</li>\n<li>以及更多！</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>语言支持</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>英语</li>\n<li>西班牙语（由 Albertosaurio 提供）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>重要提示！</h2>\n<p>安装模组更新前请务必备份您的存档，以防数据损坏。</p>\n<h2>支持我</h2>\n<p>如果您想支持我和我的工作，欢迎访问我的 Ko-fi 页面 ❤️</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fadeptstack_programmerlp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi 赞助</a></li>\n</ul>",
